      boxedWarning: noBoxed("Accidental administration can be fatal because respiratory paralysis occurs without unconsciousness. Use only with immediate ventilation/intubation, continuous sedation and analgesia, and quantitative train-of-four monitoring. Marked tachycardia, hypertension, dysrhythmia and prolonged paralysis are higher-yield concerns than with several newer alternatives."),
