      interactions: ["Volatile anesthetics, aminoglycosides, magnesium, lithium and several antiarrhythmics potentiate blockade. Renal impairment promotes accumulation. Acetylcholinesterase inhibitors can reverse appropriate residual block with antimuscarinic protection; sugammadex is not routinely used as a dependable pancuronium reversal strategy."],
