      boxedWarning: noBoxed("Contraindicated in known/suspected malignant-hyperthermia susceptibility and for pediatric inhaled induction. It is not approved for maintenance in nonintubated children because coughing, secretions and laryngospasm are increased. Rapid concentration increases can cause marked tachycardia/hypertension, especially in coronary disease. Replace desiccated CO2 absorbent to prevent carbon-monoxide exposure."),
