      interactions: ["Succinylcholine increases malignant-hyperthermia risk. Opioids, nitrous oxide and sedatives lower MAC. Desflurane potentiates nondepolarizing neuromuscular blockers. Beta blockers or other cardiovascular drugs alter the response to sympathetic surges."],
