      populationRisks: anesthesiaPopulationRisks("Contraindicated for pediatric inhaled induction and not approved for maintenance in nonintubated children because of airway reactions.", "MAC falls with age, while tachycardia, hypotension and myocardial-ischemia consequences become more important."),
